Z||000008||x cuda man||07-02-2000||08:53 PM||||thats my car! thanks alot cliff!this car fell in my lap.here's the story,i work with this guy and about 2years back he and a friend of his bought this car together to paint and sell it.(they got it for all most nothing)well they did'nt know anything about cars and i do.thought they would get me to slap a quicky paint job on it(i used to paint at a body shop before i worked with this guy)clean and tune it and get $2.500 for it.it took aboght 6 mos to get the title.the car set there for another 6 mos.i did'nt want to paint it for free.told him i'd give 500 for it and he laughed and said 1000.i ended up with it a year later for 500!!!84000 mi.it needs paint,right side fender has a small hole in it.sail panel on same side is cracked and the spoiler is gone,everything works!!i now plan on totaly restoring the car and keeping it.<p>[This message has been edited by x cuda man (edited 07-02-2000).]||||reg||6
